From e4c4b9b904a6b01e4f4d09c0d5fa85c6eca41b2c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Agnya <manthram@Pradass-MacBook-Pro.local>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 17:55:53 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] Add non-writing regression test for sample-trip seed data
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Extracts the 10 sample trips and seed-user list out of
scripts/seed-trips.ts into a new scripts/sampleTripsData.ts with no
DB import, so it can be validated from a test without a DATABASE_URL.
seed-trips.ts now resolves organizerId from organizerEmail via a
lookup map instead of holding pre-resolved ids inline, which also
removes the five hand-wired per-persona DB queries it had before.

server/__tests__/sampleTripsData.test.ts checks: exactly 10 trips,
unique ids, every id still carries the "sample-" prefix trip-card.tsx
matches on to show the Sample Trip badge, every date is in the
future, and every trip satisfies the same constraints the trips table
enforces at insert time (time/phone/email format, contact-required,
valid region and category, seats/price bounds) — so a bad edit to the
seed data fails in CI instead of failing an admin's seed run against
the live DB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
